flowchart TD
    A[JOINs] --> B[INNER JOIN]
    A --> C[OUTER JOIN]
    A --> D[CROSS JOIN]
    A --> E[NATURAL JOIN]
    A --> F[SELF JOIN]

    B --> G[Only matching rows]
    C --> H[LEFT JOIN]
    C --> I[RIGHT JOIN]
    C --> J[FULL OUTER JOIN]

    H --> K[All left rows + matches]
    I --> L[All right rows + matches]
    J --> M[All rows from both]

    N[Subqueries] --> O[Scalar subquery]
    N --> P[Row subquery]
    N --> Q[Table subquery]
    N --> R[Correlated subquery]

    O --> S[Returns single value]
    P --> T[Returns one row]
    Q --> U[FROM clause derived table]
    R --> V[References outer query]

    W[Set Operators] --> X[UNION / UNION ALL]
    W --> Y[INTERSECT]
    W --> Z[EXCEPT / MINUS]

    AA[EXISTS] --> AB[Check rows returned]
    AA --> AC[More efficient than IN]

    AD[ANY / ALL] --> AE[X greater than ANY values]
    AD --> AF[X greater than ALL values]
